{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":77,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"To the choir director, to Jeduthun. Of Asaph. A Psalm","tok":[{"t":"To the choir director, to "},{"t":"Jeduthun","s":["H3038"],"a":[2]},{"t":". Of "},{"t":"Asaph","s":["H0623"],"a":[3]},{"t":". A "},{"t":"Psalm","s":["H4210"],"a":[4]}]},{"n":1,"text":"My voice calls out to God, and I will cry out; My voice calls out to God, and He will give ear to me.","tok":[{"t":"My "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[0]},{"t":" calls out to "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[2]},{"t":", and I will cry out; My "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[4]},{"t":" calls out to "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and He will give "},{"t":"ear","s":["H0238"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to me."}]},{"n":2,"text":"In the day of my distress I sought the Lord; My hand was stretched out in the night, and it did not drop. My soul refused to be comforted.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of my distress I "},{"t":"sought","s":["H1875"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; My hand was stretched out in the "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and it did not drop. My "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"refused","s":["H3985"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"comforted","s":["H5162"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"I remember God, and I moan; I complain, and my spirit faints. Selah","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"remember","s":["H2142"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and I moan; I "},{"t":"complain","s":["H7878"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and my "},{"t":"spirit","s":["H7307"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"faints","s":["H5848"],"a":[4]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Selah","s":["H5542"],"a":[6]}]},{"n":4,"text":"You hold open my eyelids; I am disturbed and cannot speak.","tok":[{"t":"You "},{"t":"hold","s":["H0270"],"a":[0]},{"t":" open my eyelids; I am disturbed and cannot "},{"t":"speak","s":["H1696"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"I consider the days of old, The yea